  "job_B1.3.17_20261116_194725": {
    "chunk_text": "deofol \u00e6t Gode \u00fe\u00e6t he moste his fandian, hw\u00e6\u00f0er he \u00f0urhwunian wolde on his godnysse and Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a se deofol anes deges ealle his \u00e6hta acwealde, and his seofon suna and \u00f0reo dohtra, and hine Ac se anr\u00e6da Iob nolde n\u00e6fre abugan fram Godes lufe, ne for ehtnysse ne for untrumnysse ne for his God hine \u00f0a geh\u00e6lde fram \u00f0am egeslican broce, and his \u00e6hta him forgeald ealle be twifealdum, and he Dauid for his man\u00fewyrnysse and mildheortnysse wear\u00f0 Gode gecweme and to cynincge gecoren, swa Eft Helias se \u00e6\u00f0ela witega, for\u00f0an \u00fee he wan wi\u00f0 unrihtwisnysse, wear\u00f0 on heofenlicum cr\u00e6te to Eac swilce \u00fea \u00f0ry cnihtas on Chaldea lande, Sidraac, Misaac, and Abdenago, \u00fee for \u00f0an so\u00f0an geleafan Eal swa eft Danihel se deorwur\u00f0a witega, for his anfealdnysse and anr\u00e6dum geleafan wear\u00f0 tua Manega o\u00f0re heahf\u00e6deras and halige witegan w\u00e6ron wuldorfulle weras, and wundra gefremedon on Eft us secga\u00f0 bec hu \u00f0a synfullan forferdon and \u00f0a arleasan \u00e6fre for heora yfelnysse losodon, for\u00f0an \u00fee Ne eft \u00f0a arleasan \u00fee hine mid yfelnysse gremia\u00f0, ne magon n\u00e6fre \u00e6twindan \u00f0am ecum witum ahwar. Eft on \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes tocyme wear\u00f0 se halga Iohannes \u00e6tforan him asend swa swa heofonlic bydel, \u00fe\u00e6t Wite",
